After [[the Organization|the Organization's]] [[Suits]] attacked [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] at [[Lok's dormitory]], Mindrone was sent to follow them. After [[DeFoe]] granted his Suits permission to use their Amulets, MacTavish's Mindrone stopped following Lok and attacked him, using its Mindzap ability while Lok was in a phone booth. When the Suits cornered Lok, Suit 001 instructed his Mindrone to attack but it was defeated by [[Dante Vale]]'s [[Solwing]]. Elsewhere in the city, two more Mindrones were invoked by Suit 003 and Suit 004 to capture [[Sophie Casterwill]] for interrogation. These Mindrones, however, were defeated offscreen by Sophie and [[Santiago]]. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}}

Charlene Hubbs invoked her Mindrone at the [[Golem's Attic]] to attack [[Lok Lambert]] but it was defeated by his [[Freelancer]]. {{source|Words of Truth, Heart of Lies}}

[[DeFoe]] invoked his own Mindrone to attack [[Dante Vale]] alongside [[Gar-Ghoul]] in the hull of the shipwreck. After being overpowered, DeFoe was forced to admit defeat and his Mindrone retreated. {{Source|The Treasures of the Argonauts}}

[[Ford|Ford's]] Mindrone fought alongside [[Caliban]] against [[Lee Roy|Lee Roy's]] [[Enforcer]] and a pair of [[Redcap]] Titans. {{Source|The Titan of the Stage}}
